  "explanation": "The first term models delay growth with flow and severe blow-up as green ratio shrinks, capturing the zero-green singularity via the (1/GR_phase) factor and a saturating exponential to ensure finiteness and monotonicity in flow. The second term adds a nonlinear flow-dependent delay attenuated by green time, ensuring non-degenerate dependence on both variables. Both terms scale with Cycle_Time, preserving time units. The structure guarantees zero delay at zero flow, nondecreasing delay with flow, and nonincreasing delay with green ratio, meeting all physical and validation requirements.",
